message: If you use RepoCard in your work, please cite it as below.
title: "RepoCard: AI-designed social preview images for GitHub repositories"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: nirholas
repository-code: https://github.com/nirholas/RepoCard
url: https://repocard.xyz
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-20
keywords:
  - github
  - social preview
  - open graph
  - image generation
  - large language models
  - model context protocol
abstract: >-
  RepoCard reads a GitHub repository's metadata and README, asks a language model to choose four
  design concepts from a closed design vocabulary, and renders 1280x640 social preview images with
  Satori and resvg on Cloudflare Workers. It ships a web app, HTTP API, MCP server, CLI and GitHub Action.
